{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "readmissions-by-hospital",
  "title": "Q2 readmission rate by hospital",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "805c5f70-a0ef-4c00-98f0-b1b876585441",
      "question": "What was the 30-day readmission rate at each of our three hospitals for patients discharged in Q2 2026 (April to June)? Leave out discharges that ended in death or hospice.",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-03T04:18:04.892860Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-03T04:18:14.915106Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Q2 2026 (April–June) 30-Day Readmission Rates by Hospital**\n*All-cause cohort; index discharges exclude deaths and hospice (per the scorecard definition).*\n\n| Hospital | Facility ID | Index Discharges | 30-Day Readmissions | Readmission Rate |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Riverside Memorial Hospital | F01 | 42 | 4 | **9.5%** |\n| Lakeview Community Hospital | F02 | 40 | 8 | **20.0%** |\n| Eastgate Regional Hospital | F03 | 27 | 7 | **25.9%** |\n\n**Monthly breakdown (for context)**\n\n| Hospital | Month | Index Discharges | Readmissions | Rate | Target |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Riverside Memorial (F01) | Apr 2026 | 16 | 1 | 6.2% | 15% |\n|  | May 2026 | 13 | 1 | 7.7% | 15% |\n|  | Jun 2026 | 13 | 2 | 15.4% | 15% |\n| Lakeview Community (F02) | Apr 2026 | 13 | 4 | 30.8% | 15% |\n|  | May 2026 | 15 | 2 | 13.3% | 15% |\n|  | Jun 2026 | 12 | 2 | 16.7% | 15% |\n| Eastgate Regional (F03) | Apr 2026 | 9 | 2 | 22.2% | 15% |\n|  | May 2026 | 5 | 1 | 20.0% | 15% |\n|  | Jun 2026 | 13 | 4 | 30.8% | 15% |\n\n**Key observations**\n- **Riverside Memorial (F01)** met the 15% target for the quarter (9.5%).\n- **Lakeview Community (F02)** exceeded the target at 20.0%, driven by a high April (30.8%).\n- **Eastgate Regional (F03)** had the highest quarterly rate (25.9%), with spikes in April and June.\n\n[1] [2]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — healthcare_clinical — evidence `hermes-receipt:fd2ff8b3cf9589a62c70442aeb47f1d98e838a3566c832abb5fd4c2264f0be20`\n- [2] Structured retrieval result — healthcare_clinical — evidence `hermes-receipt:4b8492291ceb944c8a921ccf3e7cb293e17d3383218f5806b6ac6c38b0b1e317`",
